    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαίρω</span></b> , only pres. and
		impf., 
			Ion.
		
		impf.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαίρεσκε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1402
				</span></i>
			:— <i>skip, dance, frisk</i>, of calves, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.412
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				4.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Dian.</u>
				100
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρῇ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.1402
			</span></i>; of dancers, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποσὶ σκαίρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					18.572
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				869b9
			</span></i>. (Hence <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαρθμός, σκαρίζω</span>,
			cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσκαρίζω</span>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκιρτάω</span> is prob. Frequentat.)</div>
